{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-source-signal-severity-triage","title":"多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/quality-incident-detection-triage/multi-source-signal-severity-triage","wordCount":3062,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊规则\">多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊规则</h1><p>一批跨境出海的 20000 只移动电源，三周内触发了三条彼此独立、单看都不致命的记录：平台评论侧收集到 47 条「充电时发烫」的退货理由；第三方检验服务商（如 SGS、Bureau Veritas、Intertek、QIMA）出具的出货前检验（Pre-Shipment Inspection, PSI）报告判定抽检合格；供应商自己的 SPC 看板上，电芯点焊工序的过程能力指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 1.62 滑到 0.91。任何一条单独拿出来都不足以开出一张供应商纠正措施要求（SCAR）；但三条在同一批次维度上对齐后，指向同一个电芯热失控风险。多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊解决的，正是「把分散在五六个系统、粒度和延迟各不相同的弱信号，归一到同一维度键上，再判定它够不够格触发一次正式的纠正措施」这件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-信号-聚合与分诊\">核心概念：信号、聚合与分诊</h2><p>先厘清三个词在本章语境下的确切边界，后面所有规则都建立在它们之上。</p>\n<p><strong>信号（signal）</strong> 是一次可观测、带时间戳、可与某个供应商交付单元关联的质量记录。它的关键属性不是「好消息还是坏消息」，而是<strong>完整性</strong>：出自哪个系统、覆盖哪个批次、缺陷模式（defect mode）叫什么、事件发生时间与上报时间分别是什么。一条没有批次键的信号，无论多严重，都只能进入「待归因池」，不能直接参与分诊打分。</p>\n<p><strong>聚合（aggregation）</strong> 是把不同 schema、粒度、延迟的信号归一化到同一组维度键上，并按缺陷指纹去重，形成一个个「事件候选」。聚合的产物不是报表，而是一组带证据链的事件候选，每个候选指向若干条原始信号。</p>\n<p><strong>分诊（triage）</strong> 是依据严重度、影响范围、客户流向与时间紧迫度四个维度，把事件候选映射为事件等级（如 P1/P2/P3），并据此决定响应 SLA 与是否触发 SCAR 的规则集。分诊不做根因分析——那是下一章 <a href=\"../scar-8d-root-cause/\">8D 与根因分析</a> 的职责。</p>\n<p>信号来源可按系统载体的层级归类，各层级的采集方式与延迟差异极大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号来源层级</th>\n<th>典型系统/载体</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>延迟量级</th>\n<th>典型粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来料检验 IQC</td>\n<td>QMS / ERP 检验单</td>\n<td>AQL 抽样（ISO 2859-1）</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>检验批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过程控制 SPC</td>\n<td>MES / SPC 看板</td>\n<td>X̄-R 图、Cpk 计算（AIAG SPC）</td>\n<td>分钟</td>\n<td>工序 × 批次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产线不良 / OQC</td>\n<td>MES / 成品检验</td>\n<td>缺陷代码录入</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>工单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售后与 RMA</td>\n<td>客服工单 / 退货系统</td>\n<td>退货原因码 + 文本</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>订单 / SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台评论与舆情</td>\n<td>平台评价 / 社媒监听</td>\n<td>NLP 分类归入缺陷模式</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>SKU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方检验</td>\n<td>SGS / BV / Intertek / QIMA</td>\n<td>PSI / 工厂审核报告</td>\n<td>天</td>\n<td>检验批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商过程变化</td>\n<td>PCN / ECN、PPAP 变更、CoA</td>\n<td>供应商申报或平台强制</td>\n<td>天</td>\n<td>物料 × 变更单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流与追溯</td>\n<td>EDI 856 ASN、GS1 EPCIS</td>\n<td>事件订阅</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>批次 / SSCC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的工程含义是：<strong>采样窗口彼此不对齐</strong>。SPC 分钟级、IQC 小时级、售后与评论周级——聚合层必须同时保留「事件发生时间」（event time）与「信号到达时间」（ingest time），否则周级到达的退货信号会把三周前的过程异常误判成新发问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号采集-协议-批次键与延迟\">信号采集：协议、批次键与延迟</h2><p>采集层的设计目标只有一个：<strong>让每条信号都带上可 join 的批次键与缺陷模式标签</strong>。没有这两样，后续的聚合与分诊都无从谈起。</p>\n<p>来料端的缺陷如何按严重度分档（致命/严重/轻微）决定了 AQL 抽样的接收数，该口径见同章 <a href=\"incoming-inspection-defect-classification\">来料检验与缺陷分级</a>；抽样方案通常依据 ISO 2859-1（等同采用为 GB/T 2828.1）的接收质量限（AQL）表，一次抽检合格只代表「在该 AQL 水平下本次抽样未超接收数」，并<strong>不</strong>证明该批 DPPM 一定低——这正是上文 PSI 判定合格却仍出事的统计根源。过程端的核心指标是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DPPM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>缺陷数</mtext><mtext>检验单元数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DPPM} = \\frac{\\text{缺陷数}}{\\text{检验单元数}} \\times 10^{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPPM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检验单元数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缺陷数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} = \\min\\left(\\frac{USL - \\mu}{3\\sigma},\\ \\frac{\\mu - LSL}{3\\sigma}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>AIAG 的 SPC 参考手册把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} &lt; 1.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.33</span></span></span></span></span> 视为过程能力不足的经验阈值，跨境电商的头部平台与代工厂常把它作为「是否将供应商列入观察名单」的过程信号触发点。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是统计量而非单点测量，其可信度取决于样本量与过程稳定性，因此聚合层应保存样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与采集窗口，而不是只保存一个数字。</p>\n<p>供应商侧的变化信号——PCN（Product Change Notification）、ECN、PPAP 变更、CoA——是最高价值也最易被忽略的一类。IATF 16949:2016 的 8.5.6.1 对变更控制有明确要求，PPAP（AIAG 第四版）用 PSW（Part Submission Warrant）与提交等级 1–5 界定变更后需重新提交的证据范围。跨境电商供应链里，供应商私下更换电芯、正极材料或代工厂而不发 PCN，是批次间质量断崖的头号成因。聚合层必须把「未申报的变更」建模为一类信号：当 CoA 参数分布或来料 XRF 成分与历史基线显著偏移时，即使无人申报，也应生成一条变更疑似信号。</p>\n<p>物流与追溯侧，GS1 EPCIS 提供跨组织的「发生了什么、在哪、何时、哪个对象」事件模型，EDI 856（ASN，提前发货通知）给出批次与装运单元的对应。这两者是把「一个售后缺陷」回溯到「具体电芯批次」的桥梁——没有它们，聚合只能停在 SKU 粒度，严重度评估会因为影响范围（R）无法收敛而失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归一化与去重-防止同一个缺陷被数三次\">归一化与去重：防止同一个缺陷被数三次</h2><p>多源聚合最大的陷阱不是漏信号，而是<strong>重复计数</strong>。同一个点焊虚焊缺陷，可能同时表现为：产线 OQC 的一条不良记录、售后的一条「无法充电」RMA、平台的一条一星评论。若三条各算一次，严重度分数被虚高，分诊把 P3 抬成 P1，团队疲于救火后对分诊规则失去信任——这是分诊制度失效最常见的原因。</p>\n<p>解决方案是缺陷指纹（defect fingerprint）：用 <code>hash(material_id, defect_mode, process_step, lot_id)</code> 生成稳定标识，同一指纹下的多源信号在打分时按维度归并（如取最高严重度、累加影响数量），但保留全部原始记录作为证据链。维度键的实体解析同样关键——ERP 里的 vendor code、平台的 seller ID、检验报告的工厂名往往是同一实体的三种写法，需要一张供应商主数据映射表来校验其业务含义。</p>\n<p>时间对齐上，可用到达间隔估计各源的上报延迟，把周级的售后信号按估计时滞回拨到估计的事件时间，再与 SPC/IQC 信号对齐。这一步不必精确，只需保证「本周到达、但事件发生在上月」的信号不会被当成新发事件重复触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"严重度分诊模型-从四个维度到一个等级\">严重度分诊模型：从四个维度到一个等级</h2><p>分诊打分的四维度设计如下，每个维度都取自可核验的行业实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>D — 缺陷严重度</strong>：采用 FMEA 体系的严重度（Severity）1–10 刻度。AIAG 与 VDA 联合发布的 FMEA 手册（2019 版）明确规定，风险评估用<strong>行动优先级（Action Priority, AP）</strong> 取代旧的 RPN 相乘，因为「严重度 9 × 频度 2 × 探测度 2」这类相乘会掩盖高严重度缺陷。跨境电商的安全类缺陷（电池热失控、儿童用品小零件脱落、电器绝缘失效）应固定在高严重度档，不受频度稀释。</li>\n<li><strong>R — 影响范围</strong>：受影响单元数量或批次规模，取对数压缩后参与线性加权。</li>\n<li><strong>C — 客户流向</strong>：缺陷是否已流出至终端客户、是否已过平台不可召回点。这是唯一一个「权重应为极大值」的维度。</li>\n<li><strong>T — 时间紧迫度</strong>：缺陷批次当前处于在制、在途还是已售状态，决定能否拦截。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>综合分诊分（0–10）取加权和并截顶：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>α</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi>T</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\min\\left(10,\\ \\alpha D + \\beta \\log_{10}(1 + R) + \\gamma C + \\delta T\\right), \\qquad \\alpha + \\beta + \\gamma + \\delta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>权重按品类风险画像标定：安全敏感品类（电池、婴童、电器）把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 拉高，让「已售」几乎单独就能触发 P1；外观类品类则让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 主导，避免个别差评惊动整条供应链。等级映射见下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分诊分 S</th>\n<th>事件等级</th>\n<th>响应 SLA</th>\n<th>是否触发 SCAR</th>\n<th>典型触发场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\ge 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\ge 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>P1</td>\n<td>24 小时内启动遏制</td>\n<td>强制触发，按 8D 全流程</td>\n<td>安全缺陷已售 / 平台强制下架风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 \\le S &lt; 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>P2</td>\n<td>5 个工作日内给出初步分析</td>\n<td>触发，允许简化 8D</td>\n<td>批次性功能不良，部分已流出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\le S &lt; 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>15 个工作日内反馈</td>\n<td>观察名单，累计 3 次同指纹转 P2</td>\n<td>单批外观不良，未流出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S &lt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>P4</td>\n<td>录入趋势看板</td>\n<td>不触发</td>\n<td>偶发一致性问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>映射规则中还应有两条<strong>硬覆盖</strong>：其一，任何涉及安全与法规（如电池 UN38.3、CE/FCC、CPSC 通报）的信号，无论加权分多低，一律升为 P1，因为加权模型容许低严重度维度拉低总分，而法规风险不可被平均；其二，同一缺陷指纹在滚动窗口内重复出现达到阈值（例如 90 天内 3 次），自动升级一档，用以捕捉「每次都不严重但反复发生」的慢性问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分诊决策流与响应-sla\">分诊决策流与响应 SLA</h2><p>把上述规则串成一条可执行的流水线，各阶段边界必须清晰，避免把统计判定与工程判定混为一谈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[多源信号到达] --&gt; B[归一化: 维度键 + 缺陷指纹]&#10;    B --&gt; C[去重: 同指纹归并, 保留证据链]&#10;    C --&gt; D{时间对齐&lt;br/&gt;事件时间 vs 到达时间}&#10;    D --&gt; E[四维度打分&lt;br/&gt;D 严重度 R 范围 C 流向 T 紧迫]&#10;    E --&gt; F{硬覆盖判定&lt;br/&gt;安全/法规/重复指纹}&#10;    F --&gt;|命中| G[强制升级 P1]&#10;    F --&gt;|未命中| H[按 S 映射等级]&#10;    G --&gt; I[事件分诊单 + 证据链快照]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J{等级}&#10;    J --&gt;|P1| K[24h 遏制 + 强制 SCAR]&#10;    J --&gt;|P2| L[5 日初步分析 + SCAR]&#10;    J --&gt;|P3| M[观察名单 + 趋势累计]&#10;    J --&gt;|P4| N[看板留痕]&#10;    K --&gt; O[移交 8D / 根因分析]&#10;    L --&gt; O\">graph TD\n    A[多源信号到达] --&gt; B[归一化: 维度键 + 缺陷指纹]\n    B --&gt; C[去重: 同指纹归并, 保留证据链]\n    C --&gt; D{时间对齐&lt;br/&gt;事件时间 vs 到达时间}\n    D --&gt; E[四维度打分&lt;br/&gt;D 严重度 R 范围 C 流向 T 紧迫]\n    E --&gt; F{硬覆盖判定&lt;br/&gt;安全/法规/重复指纹}\n    F --&gt;|命中| G[强制升级 P1]\n    F --&gt;|未命中| H[按 S 映射等级]\n    G --&gt; I[事件分诊单 + 证据链快照]\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J{等级}\n    J --&gt;|P1| K[24h 遏制 + 强制 SCAR]\n    J --&gt;|P2| L[5 日初步分析 + SCAR]\n    J --&gt;|P3| M[观察名单 + 趋势累计]\n    J --&gt;|P4| N[看板留痕]\n    K --&gt; O[移交 8D / 根因分析]\n    L --&gt; O</pre><p>两个设计要点值得强调。<strong>证据链快照</strong>：分诊单创建时冻结当时的原始信号集合与批次键，因为后续 SPC 数据会滚动、评论会被删除、RMA 记录会被归档；没有冻结快照，两周后复盘时「当初为什么判 P1」无法复现，可审计性随之瓦解。<strong>等级与动作解耦</strong>：等级是事实判定，动作（遏制、SCAR、观察）是策略配置，同一等级在不同品类可挂不同动作，平台策略调整时无需改动打分模型。</p>\n<p>分诊输出的下游是两条并行的路：严重事件进入 <a href=\"../scar-8d-root-cause/\">8D 与根因分析</a> 做闭环，所有事件同时记入 <a href=\"../supplier-performance-feedback/\">供应商绩效与反馈</a> 作为评级与配额调整的输入。分诊的价值不止于「抓住最严重的那个」，更在于为绩效评级提供口径统一、可追溯的事件分母。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊的核心，是把分散在 IQC、SPC、售后、平台评论、第三方检验与供应商申报里的弱信号，通过统一的维度键与缺陷指纹归并到同一时间轴，再用严重度、影响范围、客户流向、时间紧迫度四维度加权打分，并在安全/法规与重复指纹两类情形上做硬覆盖升级。统计判定（抽样合格不等于零风险、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是统计量而非单点）与工程判定（是否触发 SCAR、多久响应）必须分层。设计上最容易失守的两处是重复计数与时间对齐——它们分别导致严重度虚高和事件误判为新发，都会直接摧毁团队对分诊规则的信任。下一章将接过 P1/P2 事件，进入 8D 与根因分析的闭环流程。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊规则","id":"多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：信号、聚合与分诊","id":"核心概念-信号-聚合与分诊"},{"level":2,"text":"信号采集：协议、批次键与延迟","id":"信号采集-协议-批次键与延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化与去重：防止同一个缺陷被数三次","id":"归一化与去重-防止同一个缺陷被数三次"},{"level":2,"text":"严重度分诊模型：从四个维度到一个等级","id":"严重度分诊模型-从四个维度到一个等级"},{"level":2,"text":"分诊决策流与响应 SLA","id":"分诊决策流与响应-sla"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"来料检验(IQC/AQL)与缺陷分级判定模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/quality-incident-detection-triage/incoming-inspection-defect-classification"},"next":{"title":"遏制隔离、MRB 评审与现场升级处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/quality-incident-detection-triage/containment-quarantine-mrb-escalation"}}